  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nFollowing World War III, all the nations of the world agreed to 50 years of strict isolation from one another in order to prevent additional conflicts. 50 years later, the United States comes out of exile, only to learn that no one else went into isolation.\n\nThe current president of the United States is shell shocked. He sees that the world is completely different. China has created war androids that have taken over much of the world. They are a technological nightmare. The world looks like a dystopian horror story. Taiwan, Japan, Africa, and Europe are now under the control of the Chinese Communist Party.\n\nThe United States has to stop the Chinese military, but they are no match for China’s war machines. They hire the best scientists they can find to quickly develop an anti-android destroyer. They are deployed in the dark of night to help reclaim territories.\n\nUnfortunately, there isn't much success, so the president decides to drop atom bombs on all of the android factories in China.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 30,
  "reference_text": " The explosions are so large, they ignite the atmosphere. The civilian casualties are enormous, but not as enormous as they would have been had the Chinese Communist Party been allowed to continue its world domination.\n\nThe American president felt bad about the civilian casualties but felt that they were necessary to bring justice back to the world.",
